{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2023-01-31 06:00:00', 'title': 'UPS RELEASES 4Q 2022 EARNINGS', 'text': 'ATLANTA--( BUSINESS WIRE )--UPS (NYSE:UPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED FOURTH-QUARTER 2022 CONSOLIDATED REVENUES OF $27.0 BILLION, A 2.7% DECREASE FROM THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021. CONSOLIDATED OPERATING PROFIT WAS $3.2 BILLION, DOWN 17.9% COMPARED TO THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021, AND DOWN 3.3% ON AN ADJUSTED BASIS. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WERE $3.96 FOR THE QUARTER; ADJUSTED DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $3.62 WERE 0.8% ABOVE THE SAME PERIOD IN 2021.'}